==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{term|mobilité|lang=frm}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|mōbilitas||mobility}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|mobilities}}

# {{context|uncountable|lang=en}} The condition of being [[mobile]]
# {{context|countable|lang=en}} A measure of the extent to which something is mobile
# {{context|countable|lang=en}} The [[movement]] of people or things
# {{context|uncountable|lang=en}} Ease of movement between economic conditions

